WEBVTT

00:00:12.750 --> 00:00:14.380
What are you doing, Shun?

00:00:14.730 --> 00:00:15.910
Kaname-kun.

00:00:16.180 --> 00:00:17.160
Let's go.

00:00:24.810 --> 00:00:25.710
Yuki.

00:00:26.110 --> 00:00:28.950
Couldn't you at least have worn
your blazer to the opening ceremony?

00:00:29.410 --> 00:00:31.460
Yuta, you're his older brother.

00:00:31.460 --> 00:00:33.500
You should be telling him these things.

00:00:34.810 --> 00:00:36.600
The cherry blossoms are amazing.

00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:38.860
They sure are. They're in full bloom.

00:00:40.350 --> 00:00:43.260
Shun, you've got a petal on your head.

00:00:43.260 --> 00:00:45.190
Thank you.

00:00:45.440 --> 00:00:47.340
Kaname, you've got a petal on you, too.

00:00:47.780 --> 00:00:49.280
Not that I'm going to remove it for you.

00:00:49.280 --> 00:00:51.230
I wouldn't want you to remove it!

00:00:51.590 --> 00:00:52.990
Good morning!

00:00:52.260 --> 00:00:52.990
Morning!

00:00:52.990 --> 00:00:54.380
Looking forward to class?

00:00:54.380 --> 00:00:56.220
I wonder who our teacher will be?

00:00:56.840 --> 00:00:58.740
I hope it's Taiazuma-sensei.

00:01:05.100 --> 00:01:08.190
We met that spring...

00:01:08.780 --> 00:01:12.210
and spent many more seasons together.

00:01:14.080 --> 00:01:15.980
It's another beautiful spring.

00:01:16.550 --> 00:01:20.050
We entered our second year at 
Homare High School this year.

00:02:51.190 --> 00:02:54.060
I spy someone spending a 
hundred yen just for some oolong tea.

00:02:56.120 --> 00:02:59.570
Who cares what I buy?

00:03:00.010 --> 00:03:03.370
I've got plenty of barley 
tea in my fridge at home.

00:03:04.130 --> 00:03:06.530
Must be nice to be a rich kid.

00:03:07.000 --> 00:03:08.710
If you're gonna buy oolong tea,

00:03:08.710 --> 00:03:10.300
you might as well get milk.

00:03:10.650 --> 00:03:12.880
Yeah, you've gotta get 
your calcium intake.

00:03:13.410 --> 00:03:15.090
That's why you're always pissed off.

00:03:15.090 --> 00:03:17.680
Whose fault is that?

00:03:17.680 --> 00:03:21.010
Kaname, I'm sure you'll end up 
buying love with money, too.

00:03:21.010 --> 00:03:23.000
I just don't get it.

00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:25.820
And I don't get how you 
guys ended up there...

00:03:25.820 --> 00:03:27.770
just from buying one oolong tea.

00:03:28.120 --> 00:03:29.410
Now, now.

00:03:29.410 --> 00:03:31.480
Let's go up on the roof.

00:03:32.410 --> 00:03:34.430
This whirlwind of sakura petals...

00:03:34.760 --> 00:03:38.030
Or, more accurately, this spring 
clouded by dust...

00:03:38.030 --> 00:03:42.530
can't begin to satiate 
the hunger of us growing boys.

00:03:50.320 --> 00:03:52.290
The wind's strong.

00:03:53.760 --> 00:03:57.510
Who suggested we eat lunch on the roof?

00:03:57.890 --> 00:04:00.380
But the weather's nice.

00:04:00.380 --> 00:04:02.510
It'd be a waste to eat 
 in the classroom.

00:04:02.800 --> 00:04:06.100
It's a bigger waste if my 
food gets covered in sand.

00:04:08.830 --> 00:04:11.510
Then, take whichever one of 
my sandwiches you'd like.

00:04:11.510 --> 00:04:14.680
You don't need to give 
Kaname anything, Shun.

00:04:15.240 --> 00:04:16.860
Eat them yourself.

00:04:18.280 --> 00:04:22.310
Kaname, why are you making such a fuss 
over a couple pieces of food?

00:04:23.250 --> 00:04:25.840
You were buying yourself oolong 
tea like a rich kid just before.

00:04:25.840 --> 00:04:27.240
You two twins,

00:04:27.240 --> 00:04:29.230
Get off my back.

00:04:29.700 --> 00:04:33.910
I'm tired of getting mixed 
up in your business.

00:04:34.590 --> 00:04:35.310
Well,

00:04:35.660 --> 00:04:38.500
Even if it's covered in sand, 
it'll all be the same in my stomach.

00:04:40.950 --> 00:04:41.920
Then...

00:04:42.310 --> 00:04:43.690
When we invited you...

00:04:44.280 --> 00:04:46.090
You should have refused.

00:04:55.860 --> 00:04:58.590
By the way, Kaname-kun and Yuki-kun...

00:04:58.590 --> 00:05:01.190
This is the first time you've 
been in the same class, isn't it?

00:05:05.650 --> 00:05:06.950
Um...

00:05:07.420 --> 00:05:10.040
Everything sucks.

00:05:10.040 --> 00:05:10.530
What?

00:05:11.630 --> 00:05:18.000
You know this guy ignores anyone 
 who tries to talk to him, right?

00:05:18.220 --> 00:05:20.250
Is that so?

00:05:20.620 --> 00:05:23.690
I don't intentionally ignore anyone.

00:05:24.490 --> 00:05:28.440
Their words simply 
don't resonate with me.

00:05:28.440 --> 00:05:31.340
You just aren't listening to them.

00:05:31.930 --> 00:05:33.060
Yuta-kun.

00:05:33.730 --> 00:05:34.900
So what?

00:05:35.440 --> 00:05:37.560
That's just who he is.

00:05:37.960 --> 00:05:42.270
As long as it isn't hurting anyone, 
who cares if he's a lone wolf?

00:05:44.320 --> 00:05:47.320
Being ignored is plenty hurtful.

00:05:47.620 --> 00:05:54.560
Yuki's not nearly accommodating 
enough nor considerate enough.

00:05:54.750 --> 00:05:56.360
He's gotta be more... you know...

00:05:56.360 --> 00:05:57.740
Shut up already.

00:05:58.540 --> 00:06:00.030
I've had enough.

00:06:00.030 --> 00:06:02.590
Kaname, you're such an old lady.

00:06:02.940 --> 00:06:05.340
You used to be so much cuter.

00:06:05.340 --> 00:06:07.540
Who are you calling "cute"?

00:06:07.540 --> 00:06:12.010
Ah, back when Kaname 
had feelings for Kaori-sensei?

00:06:12.530 --> 00:06:14.310
When did that happen?

00:06:15.350 --> 00:06:17.810
Yeah, that was hella cute.

00:06:17.810 --> 00:06:19.320
Sure was.

00:06:19.950 --> 00:06:24.750
Falling in love with your preschool teacher 
 is a little precocious, isn't it?

00:06:24.750 --> 00:06:27.290
Your innocent little eyes sparkled.

00:06:27.550 --> 00:06:29.990
Look at him now.

00:06:29.990 --> 00:06:32.830
The reflective lenses 
of his glasses sparkle.

00:06:32.830 --> 00:06:34.060
Shut up.

00:06:34.670 --> 00:06:37.280
You guys are ones to talk!

00:06:37.730 --> 00:06:38.560
What do you mean by that?

00:06:38.920 --> 00:06:41.720
You guys used to be cute little brats,

00:06:41.720 --> 00:06:44.490
getting all excitable over nothing.

00:06:48.680 --> 00:06:53.050
Apparently, the person in the middle 
loses years off their lifespan.

00:07:02.010 --> 00:07:05.250
Yuta-kun's gonna die.

00:07:05.250 --> 00:07:09.500
Yuta won't die as long 
as we don't forget him.

00:07:10.850 --> 00:07:13.780
Does my lifespan really 
decrease that quickly?

00:07:13.780 --> 00:07:15.130
Is this my last night on Earth?

00:07:15.410 --> 00:07:18.880
Fine. I'll sleep in the middle.

00:07:19.330 --> 00:07:24.540
Taking on someone else's 
life is a heavy burden.

00:07:25.930 --> 00:07:27.050
You're right.

00:07:27.600 --> 00:07:30.310
All my courage has...

00:07:31.140 --> 00:07:32.830
I just thought of a 
way we can all live...

00:07:32.830 --> 00:07:35.740
without anyone getting hurt.

00:07:36.470 --> 00:07:40.350
But I'm already hurt...

00:07:40.980 --> 00:07:42.810
Let's ask Kaname-kun to come over.

00:07:43.300 --> 00:07:45.690
Sleeping in the middle 
shortens your lifespan?

00:07:45.870 --> 00:07:47.920
Is that why you invited me over?

00:07:48.250 --> 00:07:51.320
If there's an even number of 
us, there isn't a "middle".

00:07:51.760 --> 00:07:54.030
Now we can sleep in peace.

00:08:10.540 --> 00:08:11.990
What now?

00:08:12.300 --> 00:08:16.280
Doesn't this mean both of 
us are in the middle?

00:08:17.270 --> 00:08:18.280
What?

00:08:18.710 --> 00:08:20.520
If identical twins lie side by side,

00:08:20.520 --> 00:08:23.330
it feels like we only 
count as one person.

00:08:33.420 --> 00:08:37.600
I can't sleep when I'm not next to you.

00:08:37.600 --> 00:08:39.180
Twins are a pain.

00:08:40.410 --> 00:08:41.750
For us, you mean.

00:08:42.120 --> 00:08:45.410
Oh yeah, that might have happened.

00:08:45.410 --> 00:08:47.080
But after that...

00:08:48.320 --> 00:08:50.840
How's this?

00:08:52.410 --> 00:08:56.390
I can't get any sleep with you two around.

00:08:56.390 --> 00:08:59.260
Kaname-kun, you can't sleep?

00:09:00.030 --> 00:09:01.060
Kaori-sensei.

00:09:01.480 --> 00:09:05.350
Shall I sing you a lullaby?

00:09:06.390 --> 00:09:08.610
Please don't treat me like a kid!

00:09:08.610 --> 00:09:10.990
Treat me like a man...

00:09:10.990 --> 00:09:11.860
But you are a kid.

00:09:28.870 --> 00:09:31.880
You made Shun sleep in the middle,

00:09:31.880 --> 00:09:35.290
just so you could sleep 
next to Kaori-sensei.

00:09:35.630 --> 00:09:40.410
The innocence in your eyes 
began to cloud over that day...

00:09:40.410 --> 00:09:42.390
Shut up already!

00:09:42.390 --> 00:09:43.600
In any case...

00:09:45.910 --> 00:09:49.740
Yuki, go join a club.

00:09:50.030 --> 00:09:50.800
What?

00:09:51.060 --> 00:09:55.530
It's the fastest way for you 
to get what you're missing.

00:10:32.910 --> 00:10:35.150
You here to watch? No problem.

00:10:35.150 --> 00:10:37.750
Would you like to try playing a game with us?

00:10:37.750 --> 00:10:39.010
Yes, please.

00:10:39.010 --> 00:10:39.560
Come on.

00:10:41.100 --> 00:10:44.080
A club's not something 
you force yourself into.

00:10:44.650 --> 00:10:48.410
If I don't force you to 
join, you never will.

00:10:49.030 --> 00:10:50.330
I will.

00:10:50.430 --> 00:10:53.630
I already participate in club activities daily.

00:10:53.630 --> 00:10:55.050
Yeah, you're part of 
the Going Home Club.

00:10:56.500 --> 00:10:59.060
Let's get underway.

00:10:59.060 --> 00:11:00.590
Go on.

00:11:00.790 --> 00:11:02.340
You can't run away now.

00:11:02.340 --> 00:11:04.080
Yuki-kun, you can do it.

00:11:04.080 --> 00:11:05.940
Go get the sweat, 
passion and teamwork...

00:11:05.940 --> 00:11:08.770
that's missing from your 
high school experience.

00:11:10.060 --> 00:11:12.540
You know what to do when 
you have the ball, right?

00:11:13.020 --> 00:11:13.810
Yeah, yeah.

00:11:14.420 --> 00:11:16.540
I hurl it as hard as 
I can at you, right?

00:11:16.540 --> 00:11:18.150
You pass it to your teammates!

00:11:26.630 --> 00:11:30.520
Yuki-kun obviously doesn't care.

00:11:30.520 --> 00:11:32.040
That bastard.

00:11:32.710 --> 00:11:33.880
Asaba-kun.

00:11:44.270 --> 00:11:45.800
Don't dodge it!

00:11:46.300 --> 00:11:48.570
I didn't ask for it...

00:11:48.570 --> 00:11:51.270
How are you supposed to 
play on a team like that?

00:11:52.830 --> 00:11:57.000
You've never tried very hard in PE.

00:11:57.000 --> 00:11:59.380
Are you just not really athletic?

00:11:59.380 --> 00:12:01.900
Why don't you seriously give basketball a go?

00:12:02.410 --> 00:12:04.250
Yeah, but...

00:12:04.680 --> 00:12:06.810
If you really do suck that much,

00:12:06.810 --> 00:12:09.460
you should join the Basketball Club, right?

00:12:09.990 --> 00:12:11.160
That's right.

00:12:11.340 --> 00:12:14.750
We play a lot of basketball in PE, too.

00:12:15.250 --> 00:12:16.040
See?

00:12:17.210 --> 00:12:18.920
Let's start the second half.

00:12:36.550 --> 00:12:38.340
Where the hell did that come from?

00:12:38.560 --> 00:12:41.150
Yuki's extremely athletic.

00:12:41.150 --> 00:12:42.400
What?

00:12:42.400 --> 00:12:44.440
He's even more amazing 
when he actually tries.

00:12:44.440 --> 00:12:46.120
He's even better than that?

00:12:46.120 --> 00:12:49.160
The whole Basketball Club 
can't even keep up with him.

00:12:53.090 --> 00:12:55.650
Yuki-kun's popular.

00:12:56.140 --> 00:12:58.540
What's so great about him?

00:12:58.540 --> 00:13:02.670
No girl could keep her mouth shut 
 after seeing moves that cool.

00:13:02.960 --> 00:13:06.390
What's so cool about being a ball hog?

00:13:07.130 --> 00:13:08.390
Nice shot.

00:13:16.420 --> 00:13:17.180
Begin!

00:13:27.650 --> 00:13:28.550
Ooh!

00:13:28.580 --> 00:13:29.740
Wow!

00:13:29.950 --> 00:13:32.870
A-Are you okay?

00:13:33.420 --> 00:13:34.550
Good work.

00:13:34.550 --> 00:13:36.260
What are you doing?

00:13:36.260 --> 00:13:40.010
That kid suddenly grabbed my collar.

00:13:40.510 --> 00:13:42.310
I thought he wanted something.

00:13:42.310 --> 00:13:45.050
He was doing what you'd call "judo."

00:13:47.630 --> 00:13:49.260
Swimming, huh?

00:13:51.140 --> 00:13:53.640
They say it keeps your 
shoulders from getting stiff.

00:13:54.190 --> 00:13:56.770
I guess I should think 
about my future health.

00:13:58.230 --> 00:14:02.150
Are you unable to live in the present?

00:14:02.820 --> 00:14:03.630
I'd get tired.

00:14:04.910 --> 00:14:07.280
That would end in total rejection.

00:14:11.280 --> 00:14:15.040
So, who am I supposed to shoot at?

00:14:15.040 --> 00:14:17.250
The target!

00:14:23.510 --> 00:14:28.010
Damn it, why can't you 
make up your mind?

00:14:28.330 --> 00:14:29.870
I don't need to...

00:14:29.870 --> 00:14:31.490
No, that's no good.

00:14:31.800 --> 00:14:35.490
You've got to see more of the world.

00:14:35.490 --> 00:14:39.830
I feel like my eyes 
are being forced open.

00:14:40.550 --> 00:14:41.900
What are you all doing?

00:14:43.850 --> 00:14:45.460
Azuma-sensei.

00:14:48.560 --> 00:14:51.120
A club for Yuki-kun to join, huh?

00:14:51.120 --> 00:14:53.190
He can't make up his mind.

00:14:54.030 --> 00:14:57.070
We've already checked out 
most of the athletic clubs.

00:14:57.330 --> 00:14:58.330
Athletic clubs?

00:14:58.960 --> 00:15:03.450
He's really athletic.

00:15:03.450 --> 00:15:04.250
Really?

00:15:06.390 --> 00:15:07.640
What about you, Yuta-kun?

00:15:08.620 --> 00:15:10.410
What do you think he should do?

00:15:10.930 --> 00:15:12.530
I don't know.

00:15:13.190 --> 00:15:15.060
Yuki should decide for himself.

00:15:17.550 --> 00:15:20.850
I think, well...

00:15:21.250 --> 00:15:24.520
I think you should check 
out the other clubs, too.

00:15:26.610 --> 00:15:33.300
People don't always want 
to do what they're good at.

00:15:35.890 --> 00:15:38.620
So cool.

00:15:38.620 --> 00:15:43.010
Azuma-sensei is really adult-like?

00:15:43.470 --> 00:15:46.630
Well, he is an adult, you know.

00:15:47.400 --> 00:15:49.370
What's wrong, Kaname?

00:15:49.370 --> 00:15:50.350
Nothing.

00:15:51.260 --> 00:15:53.440
It's the Cooking Club.

00:15:53.440 --> 00:15:55.100
Well? Should we...

00:15:55.100 --> 00:15:56.680
Huh? What? Yuta-kun?

00:15:56.900 --> 00:15:58.580
Not the Cooking Club.

00:15:58.580 --> 00:16:01.700
What? But Azuma-sensei said...

00:16:01.700 --> 00:16:05.010
In a middle school 
cooking class, Yuki...

00:16:07.170 --> 00:16:11.430
Y-Yuki, could you peel 
these potatoes for us?

00:16:14.480 --> 00:16:17.690
You start by holding the 
knife like this and...

00:16:19.860 --> 00:16:20.570
Amazing!

00:16:20.570 --> 00:16:21.040
So fast!

00:16:25.330 --> 00:16:26.390
Here's your knife back.

00:16:33.450 --> 00:16:35.720
You're too dangerous.

00:16:36.100 --> 00:16:39.470
I didn't mean any harm.

00:16:41.630 --> 00:16:45.880
Yuki-kun, do you want to 
check out the Tea Club?

00:17:09.020 --> 00:17:10.960
Kaname, you're nearly perfect.

00:17:11.650 --> 00:17:13.630
I guess.

00:17:15.020 --> 00:17:16.410
Yuki, you're up next.

00:17:20.240 --> 00:17:23.580
Yuki-kun, it's fine if you 
wanna take it easy today...

00:17:23.580 --> 00:17:24.720
Don't talk to me!

00:17:26.570 --> 00:17:29.290
I won't remember where 
Kaname put his mouth...

00:17:29.290 --> 00:17:31.230
I wiped it!

00:17:31.910 --> 00:17:33.590
I get it.

00:17:33.590 --> 00:17:36.580
You don't want my indirect kiss?

00:17:36.580 --> 00:17:39.140
He wanted an indirect kiss.

00:17:40.210 --> 00:17:43.000
What a creep.

00:17:40.540 --> 00:17:41.240
Seriously?

00:17:43.230 --> 00:17:45.350
I didn't want one!

00:17:45.690 --> 00:17:47.500
I know...

00:17:50.190 --> 00:17:51.080
Kaname's part of the...

00:17:51.080 --> 00:17:51.940
No.

00:17:51.940 --> 00:17:53.620
Student Council...

00:17:56.230 --> 00:17:59.700
I give up.

00:18:00.010 --> 00:18:03.980
If he doesn't want to do it, 
he'll never choose a club.

00:18:04.400 --> 00:18:09.020
And you're in no position 
to be reading manga.

00:18:09.540 --> 00:18:12.030
Cut it out.

00:18:12.030 --> 00:18:14.740
You know that I love manga and anime.

00:18:14.740 --> 00:18:17.330
Okay, okay. Is that so?

00:18:24.750 --> 00:18:26.510
Why didn't you say so earlier?!

00:18:27.260 --> 00:18:28.790
The tea cup.

00:18:28.790 --> 00:18:29.950
Kaname, you're paying for that.

00:18:29.950 --> 00:18:32.590
Yuta, you're his brother. 
You must've known.

00:18:32.590 --> 00:18:34.770
You made us waste all this time!

00:18:40.010 --> 00:18:42.970
<b>Manga Society</b>

00:18:40.380 --> 00:18:44.000
This club's perfect for you. 
It's the manga society.

00:18:44.510 --> 00:18:47.980
You can talk all you want 
about manga and anime here.

00:18:49.030 --> 00:18:52.900
Get them to stamp your admission 
form and turn it in.

00:18:53.510 --> 00:18:55.390
Man, I'm beat.

00:18:58.930 --> 00:19:02.610
Um, are you mad at Kaname-kun?

00:19:03.070 --> 00:19:04.010
Why?

00:19:04.320 --> 00:19:07.380
He's forcing you to join a club.

00:19:08.120 --> 00:19:11.960
You've been awfully hard on him today...

00:19:12.280 --> 00:19:13.430
We're always like this.

00:19:13.730 --> 00:19:20.270
Kaname-kun's just worried about you 
in his own way.

00:19:24.620 --> 00:19:28.230
Being in the middle 
shortens your lifespan...

00:19:33.860 --> 00:19:34.570
Shun...

00:19:35.590 --> 00:19:37.070
Kaname-kun...

00:19:38.000 --> 00:19:39.010
Shun.

00:19:39.290 --> 00:19:40.880
It's okay.

00:19:42.020 --> 00:19:46.080
You're getting to sleep next to 
your beloved Kaori-sensei.

00:19:46.080 --> 00:19:48.130
I'm fine.

00:19:49.940 --> 00:19:55.350
Treasure this time, okay?

00:20:07.720 --> 00:20:11.070
Let's talk about it and decide 
who'll be in the middle.

00:20:11.070 --> 00:20:14.320
Kaname-kun, I didn't know 
you cared so much...

00:20:15.910 --> 00:20:20.510
Kaname-kun showed me he cared a lot.

00:20:22.070 --> 00:20:24.160
That was because me and Yuta...

00:20:39.560 --> 00:20:42.850
Let's talk about it and decide 
who'll be in the middle.

00:20:42.850 --> 00:20:46.120
Kaname-kun, I didn't know 
you cared so much...

00:20:49.080 --> 00:20:49.880
What?

00:20:49.880 --> 00:20:51.330
Is that true?

00:20:51.330 --> 00:20:52.160
Yeah.

00:20:52.160 --> 00:20:53.190
But...

00:20:54.040 --> 00:20:59.110
Kaname-kun has always cared about us.

00:21:04.190 --> 00:21:05.260
Probably...

00:21:07.310 --> 00:21:08.950
Please forgive him.

00:21:09.090 --> 00:21:10.450
Who cares about that?

00:21:11.850 --> 00:21:13.960
Let's get that stamp and get outta here.

00:21:21.440 --> 00:21:23.920
Our 17th spring...

00:21:29.110 --> 00:21:33.040
That spring, something unchanging 
and something that's begun to change...

00:21:33.040 --> 00:21:36.830
intertwined like fluttering 
cherry blossom petals.

00:21:43.370 --> 00:21:44.960
Excuse me.

00:21:59.110 --> 00:22:01.090
It's just like the Going Home Club?

00:22:01.260 --> 00:22:01.980
Yeah.

00:22:01.980 --> 00:22:03.780
So what?

00:22:03.780 --> 00:22:06.590
Did you really join that club?

00:22:06.760 --> 00:22:07.340
Yeah.

00:22:07.500 --> 00:22:08.960
Are you stupid?

00:22:09.560 --> 00:22:14.190
This sucks. This is pointless.

00:22:14.190 --> 00:22:15.490
But, look...

00:22:15.490 --> 00:22:20.030
You managed to achieve your goal 
of getting Yuki-kun to join a club.

00:22:20.540 --> 00:22:22.650
Yeah, that's true.

00:22:23.020 --> 00:22:26.360
There's an 80% chance nothing 
will change, though.

00:22:28.820 --> 00:22:30.110
Maybe, but...

00:22:30.550 --> 00:22:36.330
I'm sure there'll be plenty 
of changes yet to come.

00:22:39.880 --> 00:22:44.920
On Our 17th Spring

00:24:15.890 --> 00:24:20.210
The Day the Tulips Bloomed

00:24:16.000 --> 00:24:19.030
Next Time: The Day the Tulips Bloomed.
